<article id="sys~motor.thermal-protection-q7m2~1" class="detail partial" data-search="sys~motor.thermal-protection-q7m2~1 thermal protection of the motor" data-type="sys" data-status="approved" data-coverage="partial" data-tags="">
<h3><span class="sign" title="covered, gap below" aria-hidden="true">!</span><span class="sr-only">covered, gap below</span> <code>sys~motor.thermal-protection-q7m2~1</code> Thermal protection of the motor</h3>
<dl class="facts">
<div><dt>Level</dt><dd>L2 – System Requirements</dd></div>
<div><dt>Status</dt><dd>approved</dd></div>
<div><dt>Verified</dt><dd>no</dd></div>
<div><dt>Location</dt><dd><code>reqs&#x2f;system.md:4</code></dd></div>
<div><dt>Source</dt><dd>Customer specification ch. 4.2</dd></div></dl>
<div class="text">
<p>The drive protects the motor winding against overheating.</p>
</div>
<h4>Rationale</h4>
<div class="text">
<p>Overheating destroys the winding insulation.</p>
</div>
<h4>Covered by</h4>
<ul class="links">
